# r48 part AI: the server's own AI models (docs/hosting/off-cloudflare.md, section 2.2), pinned. Read by deploy-vps (the
# site's web.env) and by warm.sh on the server. A model whose digest differs from the pin is removed and not used.
#   Ollama shows each model's digest as its first 12 characters (`ollama list`, ID; /api/tags, digest): those are pinned.
#   The whisper model is checked against the SHA-1 whisper.cpp publishes (models/README.md).
# Why these (VPS-4: 8 vCPU, 24 GB, no GPU): Qwen2.5 3B Instruct (Q4_K_M, 1.9 GB) is the best JSON-following model that
# answers a short chat reply in seconds on four CPU threads (7B is about 2.5 times slower); Qwen2.5-VL 3B (3.2 GB) reads a
# plate or sorts a photo in about half a minute, far better at JSON than moondream; Whisper small.en (466 MiB) is
# about four times the accuracy-per-second of base.en for phone audio and still faster than real time on two threads.
OLLAMA_IMAGE=ollama/ollama:0.12.6
LOCAL_LLM_MODEL=qwen2.5:3b
LOCAL_LLM_DIGEST=357c53fb659c
LOCAL_VISION_MODEL=qwen2.5vl:3b
LOCAL_VISION_DIGEST=fb90415cde1e
WHISPER_VERSION=v1.7.6
WHISPER_MODEL=small.en
WHISPER_MODEL_SHA1=db8a495a91d927739e50b3fc1cc4c6b8f6c2d022
